[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7800.87, "timestamp": "02:10:00", "text": "我们的脸。去做就对了。毙了他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7803.189, "timestamp": "02:10:03", "text": "不，别这么做。解开谜题就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7805.669, "timestamp": "02:10:05", "text": "拜托了，替我问好。就像所有人一样，嘿，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7808.39, "timestamp": "02:10:08", "text": "不射杀朱皮医生。我们我们我们爱博士。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7810.709, "timestamp": "02:10:10", "text": "朱比。谢谢。谢谢。你是什​​么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7812.55, "timestamp": "02:10:12", "text": "大家怎么说？我该开枪打死他吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7814.87, "timestamp": "02:10:14", "text": "不是？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7818.709, "timestamp": "02:10:18", "text": "他说他改了姓氏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7821.91, "timestamp": "02:10:21", "text": "很多兄弟姐妹都叫很多名字。不，不。他的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7823.31, "timestamp": "02:10:23", "text": "儿子的名字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7826.87, "timestamp": "02:10:26", "text": "很多。是啊，我的意思是，孩子们会取很多名字。三"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7828.109, "timestamp": "02:10:28", "text": "次数"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7831.51, "timestamp": "02:10:31", "text": "G确实看到了这一点。我觉得我需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7833.51, "timestamp": "02:10:33", "text": "开枪打死他，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7836.55, "timestamp": "02:10:36", "text": "你他妈的在干什么？你们这些白痴。怎么会这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7840.31, "timestamp": "02:10:40", "text": "你个混蛋。是他。我的天啊。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7842.069, "timestamp": "02:10:42", "text": "自作聪明。我们搞定了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7844.629, "timestamp": "02:10:44", "text": "也。我们很聪明。优秀的团队。好的，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7847.03, "timestamp": "02:10:47", "text": "尸体把什么东西带到了那个房间里。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7849.27, "timestamp": "02:10:49", "text": "跟着做。我的天哪。是他。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7852.55, "timestamp": "02:10:52", "text": "上帝。正是道格拉斯本人。我的天啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7855.43, "timestamp": "02:10:55", "text": "那个小鬼。等等，我们杀了他？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7858.149, "timestamp": "02:10:58", "text": "正确的？还要多久？你们就是那些人"}]